<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>GnoMe Chat</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <script
      src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"
      integrity="sha256-/JqT3SQfawRcv/BIHPThkBvs0OEvtFFmqPF/lYI/Cxo="
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <nav>
        <div class="container">
          <img class="logo" src="Assets/img/Logo.png" alt="" />
          <h2>Get to GnoMe</h2>
          <div class="online-status">5000+ online now</div>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div class="main-container">
        <p>
          You don't need an app to use GnomeChat on your phone/tablet! The web
          site works great on mobile browsers.
        </p>
        <p>GnomeChat is a great way to make friends.</p>
        <p>Chat anonymously using either our text or video chat pages.</p>
        <p>
          YOU MUST BE 18 OR OLDER TO USE GnomeChat. See GnomeChat's Terms of
          Service for more info.
        </p>
        Users must be 18 years of age or older.
        <h2 class="monitored-text">Welcome.</h2>
        <div class="action-container">
          <p class="start-chat">Start chatting</p>
          <div class="button-container">
            <button class="action-button">
              <a href="/text-chat">Text Chat</a>
            </button>
            <button class="action-button">
              <a href="/video-chat">Video Chat</a>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
